**Hypothesis:** Dual-row schedule levers are exhausted (pair_stream / chunk2 / perrow_wphase / single_row DEAD). Each quad still does 8×(sc+zp) = 16 header VMEM ops. Packing adjacent `sc|zp` into one `uint2` load on gfx12 should cut that to 8 and free issue slots, without changing DOG math.

**Variant:** `/tmp/exp_R5c0.hip` — gfx12-only `LOAD_W` via `uint2`; non-gfx12 path unchanged (cross-arch safe).

