    15	//   - Block: (32, 1, 1)
    16	//   - expert_outputs[bid * K_TOP * M + krank * M + row] = dot(A_expert[row], x_token_expert)
    17	//   - 0 atomicAdd. Caller folds via moe_down_combine_k8_batched.
