## Round 19 complete

**Target:** `gemv_hfq4g256_residual` (6.7% wall, BOD: occ 22.5%, L2 77.6%, mem_busy 45.3%, vgpr 72 — L2-resident/mem-busy). Preferred over higher-wall kernels with denser dead ledgers; skipped all `[EXHAUSTED]`.

**Hypothesis:** Peak live state is the full-quad x-hoist (32 floats) plus 8 weight headers. Streaming per-group x+w on gfx12 should cut VGPR and raise occupancy if residual is occupancy-starved rather than MLP-limited.

**Lever:** `res_x_pergroup` — gfx1201-only per-group load/DOG scopes; other archs keep the baseline body byte-identical.

