3:# Harness-v2 certify. Core change vs v1: ADAPTIVE SAMPLING instead of fixed 4/8 rounds +
4:# magnitude floor. Sample until the MWU dominance f decisively resolves, so real-but-noisy
6:# wins-only branch (loop/card<N>); everything logs to the JSONL. NO fold until rollover.
8:# Verdict:  f>=0.90 & delta>FLOOR & gated -> WIN
9:#           f<=0.65 (or delta<-FLOOR & f<=0.35) & gated -> DEAD
10:#           0.65<f<0.90 at CAP rounds -> INCONCLUSIVE (parked; re-openable on rerun)
11:#           var_coh=BAD -> COHERENCE_FAIL ;  clock skew -> VOID   (both regardless of f)
