**Target:** `fused_rmsnorm_mq_rotate` (ACTIVE, 4.6% wall, 1/10 dead — fewest attempts among ACTIVE kernels)

**BOD bottleneck:** latency/occ-starved — occ **0.1%**, mem_busy **18%**, L2 **73%**, VGPR **48**, grid=**[1]** (structurally one block / 64 CUs)

**Hypothesis (`rms_sos_pipe1_nopref`):** R36 (drop cross-barrier pref) freed VGPR 48→40 but was alone DEAD; R22/R35 softpipes raised VGPR 48→56 on top of that pref ring. Stack them: drop pref, spend the freed budget on 1-deep Phase-1a SoS soft-pipe (same accumulation order → value-preserving).

