|---|---|---|---|---|
| Ungated | **CROSS_ARCH** | +2.17% | 1.0 | VGPR→40; phantom / non-isolated |
| Arch-gated `#if gfx1200/1201` | **DEAD** | **−1.64%** | **0.125** | VGPR→40, mem_busy 18→30%, occ stuck 0.2% |

