codex
The preserved stderr identified the real issue: the variant’s lazy HIP JIT failed because I referenced `lane_id`, which is not declared in this kernel (the source only has `tid`). The first two `PARITY_FAIL` reports were therefore empty-output build-path failures, not numerical mismatches. I’m correcting the same variant to use `(tid & 31)` and will certify it once.
